<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50399" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vēnātus</span></b> ,
		ūs, m.
		id.. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i>hunting</i>, <i>the chase</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">labor in venatu,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Tusc. 5, 34, 98</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 7, 747</span></i>; <i><span class="en">9, 605</span></i>;
				<i><span class="en">Ov. M.
				3, 163</span></i>.—<i>Plur.</i>, <i><span class="en">Ov. M. 4,
				302</span></i>; <i><span class="en">4, 307</span></i>; <i><span class="en">4, 309</span></i>.—
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>Fishing</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">capere in venatu,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plaut. Rud. 4, 3, 31</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>Game</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">venatus aggerere,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					8, 16, 21, § 58</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vesci venatu,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 7,
					2, 2, § 23</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Amm. 23, 6, 50</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
